## Tier 1 commands

| Command | Use for |
|---------|---------|
| `/execute-plan` | Multi-phase plans — [`execute-plan` skill](../skills/execute-plan/SKILL.md) |
| `/babysit` or `/autopilot` | Lightweight PR merge-ready loop — [`babysit` skill](../skills/babysit/SKILL.md); cloud handoff via built-in `/autopilot` |
| `/babysit-plus` | PR triage, CI, merge — [`babysit-plus` skill](../skills/babysit-plus/SKILL.md) |
| `/babysit-uat` | Final merge to `main` + pre-UAT — [`babysit-uat` skill](../skills/babysit-uat/SKILL.md) |
| `/e2e-debug` | Pre-UAT remedial → chain babysit-uat |
| `/ui-design-deep` | Multi-screen design + implementation |

Each Tier 1 skill runs the **Router** first, then applicable protocols under `.cursor/agent-kernel/protocols/`.

## Definition of done

